name wordcloud
category Package
revision 68209
shortdesc Drawing wordclouds with MetaPost and Lua
relocated 1
longdesc This MetaPost and LuaLaTeX package allows drawing wordclouds
longdesc from a list of words and weights. The algorithm is implemented
longdesc with MetaPost whereas Lua is used to parse LaTeX commands, to
longdesc build the list of words and weights from a text file and to
longdesc generate MetaPost code interpreted by luamplib.
runfiles size=8
 RELOC/metapost/wordcloud/wordcloud.mp
 RELOC/tex/latex/wordcloud/wordcloud.lua
 RELOC/tex/latex/wordcloud/wordcloud.sty
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/chupinmaxime/wordcloud/issues
catalogue-contact-home https://plmlab.math.cnrs.fr/mchupin/wordcloud
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/chupinmaxime/wordcloud
catalogue-ctan /graphics/metapost/contrib/macros/wordcloud
catalogue-license lppl1.3c fdl
catalogue-topics luatex mp-use
catalogue-version 0.2
